    cineris-ext skills::tests::a_skill_needs_front_matter_with_a_name_and_its_quirks_are_read

[break] one-name-is-listed-twice
rule: One name is one skill: of two skills with one name, one is taken and the other left out with its reason.
file: crates/cineris-ext/src/skills.rs
in: find_seeing
find: kept.name == skill.name
replace: false
caught-by:
    cineris-ext skills::tests::one_name_is_one_skill_the_projects_first_then_cineris_agents_claude

[break] the-users-skill-is-taken-over-the-projects
rule: Of two skills with one name, the project's is taken over the user's.
